<p id="S3.p2.6" class="ltx_p">Summing the contributions from <math id="S3.p2.m58" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{I}_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{I}_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.p2.m59" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{I}_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{I}_{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, and substituting the values <math id="S3.p2.m60" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle|V_{p}|=(p-1)(q-1),|V_{p^{2}}|=q-1,|V_{q}|=p(p-1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle|V_{p}|=(p-1)(q-1),|V_{p^{2}}|=q-1,|V_{q}|=p(p-1)</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="S3.p2.m61" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle|V_{pq}|=p-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle|V_{pq}|=p-1</annotation></semantics></math>, we obtain the independence polynomial of <math id="S3.p2.m62" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>G</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle G</annotation></semantics></math> as</p>
