<p id="S4.p6.3" class="ltx_p">The zero set of <math id="S4.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle I(\varGamma(\mathbb{Z}_{30}),x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ℤ</mi><mn>30</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle I(\varGamma(\mathbb{Z}_{30}),x)</annotation></semantics></math> is plotted in (a) Figure <a href="#S4.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ 4 Independence polynomial of zero divisor graph of order 𝑝⁢𝑞⁢𝑟 ‣ Combinatorial and analytic aspects of independence polynomials of zero divisor graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, and its zeros <math id="S4.p6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle x</annotation></semantics></math> (other than <math id="S4.p6.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle x=-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle x=-1</annotation></semantics></math>) lying in the annular region <math id="S4.p6.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\tfrac{1}{2}&lt;|1+x|&lt;2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\tfrac{1}{2}&lt;|1+x|&lt;2</annotation></semantics></math> is shown in (b) Figure <a href="#S4.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ 4 Independence polynomial of zero divisor graph of order 𝑝⁢𝑞⁢𝑟 ‣ Combinatorial and analytic aspects of independence polynomials of zero divisor graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>.</p>
