<p id="S4.F5.4" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center">(a) Zeros of <math id="S4.F5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle I(\varGamma(\mathbb{Z}_{30}),x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ℤ</mi><mn>30</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle I(\varGamma(\mathbb{Z}_{30}),x)</annotation></semantics></math>      (b) Annular <math id="S4.F5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\tfrac{1}{2}&lt;|1+x|&lt;2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\tfrac{1}{2}&lt;|1+x|&lt;2</annotation></semantics></math></p></div></div>
